  "universal_guidelines": [
    "Do NOT use gradients for backgrounds. Use solid colors or noise textures.",
    "Do NOT use rounded-xl or rounded-2xl. Keep it sharp (rounded-none or rounded-sm).",
    "Always use 'Inter' or 'Manrope' for UI text, but 'JetBrains Mono' for ANY number or code.",
    "Dashboard must be high density. No wasted whitespace in the trading panel.",
    "Use 'Safety Orange' (#FF5F00) sparingly but boldly (Primary Buttons, Active Tabs, Alerts).",
    "Ensure 100% viewport height layouts for dashboard (no scroll on body, scroll inside panels).",
    "Use 'sonner' for toast notifications.",
    "Use 'recharts' for data visualization.",
    "All interactive elements must have data-testid attributes.",
    "Dark Mode is the default for User Dashboard. Admin Dashboard can use a 'Navy/Blue' theme to differentiate.",
    "Login/Auth pages should be split-screen (Image Left/Right, Form Opposite)."
